        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Cache, Oklahoma\n- People: Quanah Parker\n- Organizations: Quahadi Comanche, Comanche people\n- Concepts: Indian Wars, reservation life\n\nFacts:\n- Quanah Parker was born in about 1845 or 1852 and died on February 23, 1911.\n- Quanah Parker was a Comanche war leader of the Quahadi band of the Comanche people.\n- Quanah Parker was the major leader of the Quahadi Comanche during the years of the Indian Wars and the transition to reservation life.\n- Cache, Oklahoma is the location of Star House, the home of Quanah Parker.",
